ampling","body":"Cut Chemist's music is grouped with that of J Dilla and DJ Shadow as exemplifying an artisanal, pure craftsmanship approach to the sampling process. This refers to the manual, ear-driven method of creating tracks with limited technology, which gave their music a distinctive, raw quality marked by subtle imperfections. \"te recordaba los discos de Catkemi's, a los de DJ's a Do, a los de DJ's a Do, a los de J.D. La, te recordaba todos estos discos donde todo el proceso de Sample y de Artesania pura.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"DJ SHADOW - Endtroducing... (la música con desechos)","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_WFtfeq-7y8"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Early Sampling Peer","body":"Cut Chemist is mentioned as a peer of DJ Shadow and Mix Master Mike, appearing with DJ Shadow in early hip hop documentaries. His work is associated with the artisanal, manual sampling techniques of the 90s, reminiscent of J Dilla and DJ Shadow, which contributed to the distinct sound of that era. \"Tenemos grabaciones de documentales de hip hop, en el que está DJ se ha dado, con Quiebre, con Kat Kimis, con Mixmaster Mike.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"DJ SHADOW - Endtroducing... (la música con desechos)","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_WFtfeq-7y8"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":146753796200078,"type":"album","name":"The Audience's Listening","list_id":207888058697001,"list":"RYM Top — Hip Hop — Instrumental Hip Hop","src":"musthear","rank":124,"year":2006,"note":null,"yt":"HsI9V_HgUnw","scaruffi":null},{"id":146753796200078,"type":"album","name":"The Audience's Listening","list_id":38968292711990,"list":"RYM Top — Hip Hop — Turntablism","src":"musthear","rank":1,"year":2006,"note":null,"yt":"HsI9V_HgUnw","scaruffi":null},{"id":17620103566466,"type":"album","name":"The Audience Is Listening","list_id":76687108203,"list":"Scaruffi 2000s","src"